  - type: report
    title: "Does a single releaser predict a release stall? A predictive check of hrg-3"
    authors:
      - family-names: "Aleinikov"
        given-names: "Aleksei"
        orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-8866-3131"
    year: 2026
    url: "https://github.com/LF3551/human-risk-graph/blob/v0.14.1/docs/validation-hrg3.md"
    abstract: "Retrospective cohort of 284 popular PyPI projects with index date 2024-11-01, protocol committed before data collection. A single release author before the index date went with a 4.8 times higher rate of no release in the following year (95% CI 1.5-15.3); a commit-based truck factor gave 1.9 (0.9-4.3); adjusted for release activity 2.7 (0.8-9.2)."

